  "descriptionHtml": "<div class='product-description'><p>Throw it back to 2008 with the ASICS GEL-1130, a sneaker that perfectly blends retro runner vibes with modern comfort. Inspired by the legendary GEL-KAYANO 14, these kicks feature breathable mesh and textured suede paneling for a look that dominates the streets. Every stride feels effortless thanks to the GEL technology in the heel and the stability of the signature TRUSSTIC support system.<br><ul><li>Mesh and suede upper provides breathability and a premium look</li><li>GEL technology in the heel offers excellent shock absorption</li><li>TRUSSTIC support system improves stability for all-day wear</li><li>EVA midsole delivers lightweight cushioning and comfort</li><li>Rubber outsole ensures durable traction on various surfaces</li></ul><br><b>Material & Care</b><br><ul><li>Suede, mesh, and fabric upper</li><li>EVA midsole</li><li>Rubber outsole</li></ul><br><b>Size & Fit</b><br><ul><li>Lace up closure for a secure fit</li><li>Round toe design</li><li>Mid vamp coverage</li></ul></p></div>\n\n<div class=\"product-specifications\" style=\"margin: 20px 0;\">\n  <h3 style=\"font-size: 16px; margin-bottom: 8px;\">Specifications</h3>\n  <table style=\"width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; font-size: 14px;\">\n    <tbody><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Brand</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>ASICS®</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Model</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>ASICS® GEL 1130 - Men's</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Gender</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Men's</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Color</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Black/White/Blue</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Width</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Width - D - Medium</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Material</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Premium upper with durable overlays and responsive traction outsole</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Manufacturer SKU</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>1203B266-100</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Category</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Shoes</td></tr></tbody>\n  </table>\n</div>\n\n\n<details class=\"size-guide-accordion\" style=\"margin: 20px 0; padding: 12px; border: 1px solid #e0e0e0; border-radius: 6px;\">\n  <summary style=\"font-weight: 600; cursor: pointer; font-size: 15px;\">ASICS® Size Guide &amp; Conversions (Men's)</summary>\n  <div style=\"margin-top: 12px;\">\n    <p style=\"font-size: 13px; color: #666; margin-bottom: 8px;\">Official ASICS® shoe size conversion matrix (US / UK / EU):</p>\n    <table style=\"width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; font-size: 13px;\">\n      <thead>\n        <tr style=\"background-color: #f5f5f5;\">\n          <th style=\"padding:6px 12px;text-align:center;\">US Size</th>\n          <th style=\"padding:6px 12px;text-align:center;\">UK Size</th>\n          <th style=\"padding:6px 12px;text-align:center;\">EU Size</th>\n          <th style=\"padding:6px 12px;text-align:center;\">Availability</th>\n        </tr>\n      </thead>\n      <tbody><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;text-align:center;'>US 8</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;text-align:center;'>UK 7</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;text-align:center;'>EU 43.0</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;text-align:center;'>In Stock</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;text-align:center;'>US 8.5</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;text-align:center;'>UK 7.5</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;text-align:center;'>EU 43.6</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;text-align:center;'>In Stock</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;text-align:center;'>US 9</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;text-align:center;'>UK 8</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;text-align:center;'>EU 44.2</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;text-align:center;'>In Stock</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;text-align:center